# Frozen and collected data is stored and checked out BYTE-FOR-BYTE.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf rewrites line endings on a Windows checkout,
# so a sha256 taken there covers bytes that exist in no commit. Eleven
# manifest hashes were exactly that until 2026-11-18 (docs/cleanroom.md,
# REPRODUCIBILITY FINDING). A content hash must mean the committed bytes.
data/** -text
